  end note
}

:Consistent pseudo-labels\nacross all datasets;

' ============================================================================
' MODEL TRAINING WORKSTREAM
' ============================================================================
|Model Training|

partition "Production Model Training" {
  :Train SigLIP 2 NAFlex Multi-Task;
  note right
    **Purpose:**
    Full document analysis model
    16 heads across 5 groups
    (~50ms GPU inference)

    **Data:**
    10 purpose-built datasets (~503K)

    **Source:**
    - src/.../training/siglip2_trainer.py
    - src/.../models/siglip2_naflex.py

    **Scripts:**
    - modal/train_siglip2_multitask.py
  end note

  :Train MobileNetV4-Conv-S;
  note right
    **Process (3-step virtuous cycle):**
    1. Train on synthetic GT labels
    2. Train SigLIP 2 multi-task
    3. Re-train with SigLIP 2 soft labels
       (KL-divergence, T=3)

    **Workflow:**
    [[project-a-distillation.puml]]

    **Source:**
    - src/.../training/mobilenetv4_trainer.py
    - src/.../training/generate_soft_labels.py

    **ADR:**
    [[docs/ADRs/0028-resnet-teacher-student.md]]
    (SUPERSEDED by SigLIP 2 multi-task)
  end note

  :Export MobileNetV4 Pre-Correction;
  note right
    **Purpose:**
    Fast pre-correction model
    3 heads (~3ms inference)
    orientation, skew, resolution quality

    **Source:**
    - src/.../training/mobilenetv4_trainer.py
    - src/.../models/mobilenetv4_conv_s.py

    **Scripts:**
    - modal/train_mobilenetv4_precorrection.py
  end note
}

partition "Layout Model Training" {
  :Fine-tune Docling Layout Models;
  note right
    **Dataset:**
    DocLayNet (80K pages, 11+ classes)

    **Models:**
    - docling-layout-egret-xlarge (accuracy)
    - docling-layout-heron (speed)

    **Scope:**
    Full layout analysis including
    reading order and table structure
    (moved from Project B)

    **Scripts:**
    - modal/train_docling_layout.py
  end note
}

partition "Model Export" {
  :Export to ONNX;
  note right
    **Scripts:**
    - modal/export_phase7_onnx.py

    **Source:**
    - src/.../models/model_optimizer.py
  end note
  :Upload to Model Registry\n(GCS);
  note right
    **Source:**
    - src/.../utils/gcs_uploader.py

    **Documentation:**
    [[docs/MODEL_STORAGE.md]]
  end note
}

:Production-ready models;

' ============================================================================
' PRODUCTION RUNTIME
' ============================================================================
|Production Runtime|

partition "Document Processing" {
  :Receive document\n(PDF/Image);

  :Pre-flight analysis;
  note right
    - DPI detection
    - Upscaling if needed
    - PDF type classification

    **Workflow:**
    [[project-a-primary-workflow-high-level.puml]]

    **Source:**
    - src/.../ingestion/pdf_analyzer.py
    - src/.../ingestion/pdf_resolution.py
    - src/.../ingestion/pdf_upscaler.py
    - src/.../classification/pdf_type_classifier.py

    **Documentation:**
    [[docs/api/ingestion.md]]
  end note

  :Text Gate routing;
  note right
    Fast ensemble heuristics
    <10ms per page

    **Source:**
    - src/.../detection/text_gate.py

    **Documentation:**
    [[docs/api/detection.md]]
  end note

  fork
    :Classical IQA\n(7 detectors);
    note left
      **Source:**
      src/.../detection/iqa_classical.py
    end note
  fork again
    :MobileNetV4-Conv-S\nPre-Correction (3 heads);
    note left
      **Source:**
      src/.../detection/iqa_ml.py
      **Heads:** orientation, skew,
      resolution quality (~3ms)
    end note

    :SigLIP 2 NAFlex\nMulti-Task (16 heads);
    note right
      **5 Head Groups (~50ms):**
      IQA, Script, Orientation+Skew,
      Handwriting, Page Attrs

      **Fallback:**
      Confidence-based classical
      fallback (6 head-specific rules)

      **Source:**
      - src/.../detection/iqa_ml.py
      - src/.../orchestration/device_orchestrator.py
    end note
  fork again
    :Layout Analysis\n(Docling Layout Models);
    note right
      **Full Layout Detection:**
      - 11+ DocLayNet classes
      - docling-layout-egret-xlarge (accuracy)
      - docling-layout-heron (speed)

      **Source:**
      - src/.../detection/doclayout_yolo.py
      - src/.../detection/layout_lite/*.py

      **Scope Change:**
      Layout moved from Project B
      to Project A for efficiency
    end note
  end fork

  :Apply corrections;
  note left
    **Source:**
    src/.../correction/corrections.py

    **Documentation:**
    [[docs/api/correction.md]]
  end note

  :Calculate DQS + routing;
  note right
    **Source:**
    - src/.../metrics/dqs_calculator.py
    - src/.../routing/recommendation_engine.py

    **ADR:**
    [[docs/ADRs/0030-document-quality-score.md]]

    **Detailed Implementation:**
    [[project-a-primary-workflow-detailed.puml]]
  end note
}

:DocumentMetadata.json\n+ Corrected images;

:Handoff to Project B;
note right
  **AB Contract:**
  - Quality assessment
  - Layout detection results
  - Reading order + table structure
  - Routing recommendation
  - Corrected page images

  **Source:**
  - src/.../schema.py
  - src/.../output/json_generator.py

  **Documentation:**
  [[docs/api/schema.md]]
  [[docs/guides/project-b-handoff.md]]

  **Project B Focus:**
  OCR orchestration only
  (layout analysis now in A)
end note

stop

